#. module: incubacloud_pitr
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:incubacloud_pitr.field_cloud_instance__pitr_enabled
msgid ""
"Archive this production instance's database continuously and copy its "
"filestore as it changes, so it can be restored to any minute of its backup "
"window. Needs a backup backend. Switching it on or off rebuilds the instance"
" and restarts its database once."
msgstr ""
"Archiva de forma continua la base de datos de esta instancia de producción y"
" copia su filestore a medida que cambia, para poder restaurarla a cualquier "
"minuto de su ventana de backups. Necesita un backend de backups. Activarla o"
" desactivarla reconstruye la instancia y reinicia su base de datos una vez."

