#. module: incubacloud_pitr
#: model:cloud.job.type,description:incubacloud_pitr.pitr_restore
msgid ""
"Restores the instance's database to a chosen minute of its window, and its "
"filestore with it. Odoo is stopped meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"Restaura la base de datos de la instancia a un minuto elegido de su ventana,"
" y su filestore con ella. Odoo se detiene mientras tanto."

#. module: incubacloud_pitr
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:incubacloud_pitr.field_cloud_instance__pitr_timelines
